WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.324
Today is the final check. It takes about three minutes.

2
00:00:03.774 --> 00:00:08.325
Do it the day after day nine, not on the same day. The point is what has stayed.

3
00:00:08.775 --> 00:00:12.165
Your child uses their page. You have the grown-up page.

4
00:00:12.615 --> 00:00:19.736
Part A. Your child says the sound of each letter. Part B. You tap a sound under this video, and your child points to it.

5
00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:25.136
The letters are in an order your child has not met, so the row cannot be said by heart.

6
00:00:25.586 --> 00:00:30.807
Part C. Six words your child has never seen. They are read slowly, and that is fine.

7
00:00:31.257 --> 00:00:32.380
Do not help today.

8
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:37.509
Write the three numbers on your page. Then put it beside the page from day one.

9
00:00:37.959 --> 00:00:45.849
Your page tells you what the result means, and exactly what to do next. That includes what to do if the sounds have not stayed yet.

10
00:00:46.299 --> 00:00:50.967
Then scan the code at the top for the report. And let your child color the last star.
